  "description": "<ul><li><strong>Effect: </strong>See the table above for unarmed damage by level.</li><li>Your unarmed attacks use Strength or Dexterity (your choice).</li><li>At 6th level you gain a second unarmed attack, and at 16th a third, whenever you use your action to attack (the Secondary and Tertiary columns).</li><li>They are rolled normally, are not off-hand attacks, and stack with Flowing Strikes and Haste.</li><li>A Monk never gains Extra Attack.</li><li>The monk has <strong>Advantage</strong> on all overbearing and grappling attacks</li><li>The monk may choose whether a successful strike deals normal damage or subdual damage</li></ul>",
